<!-- 4. OUR APPROACH (Side-by-side Architectural Composition) -->
<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-20 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Large Architectural Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl group">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] w-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuArlVYmcjkKceolCRUisH-oL4z0jinVXeLXZ9sUuFBAIXcn0uP5OYGwOSojiOlBDxDER2VqB7yW3SBzXETadoCUxtAxs_6a0ONcrJUCAIEFPCIFp17Hfw3DHwGHZrYUNSQ_ZUIgAGk_B5BaECOZ6zcGCRHVkwQ-1h8biL8WM4YbWwBZVzVP_XmjMnPhgkuUwq3eQmCHh_QGA5smpKMQRZqApPHQg2PA1uYu-hZoX84sFbHARW9p6nb3rA')"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-3 sm:bottom-4 left-3 sm:left-4 right-3 sm:right-4 p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-lg bg-inverse-surface/85 backdrop-blur-md text-inverse-on-surface flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase font-label tracking-widest text-outline-variant">Project Showcase</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium text-inverse-primary">The Solstice Residence — Interior Craft</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Side: Narrative & 4 Step Progression -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col">
        <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-primary uppercase mb-2 sm:mb-3">OUR APPROACH</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
          FROM AN IDEA TO A COMPLETED SPACE.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6 sm:mb-10">
          Every project begins with understanding the client's lifestyle, site topography, and overarching vision. From there, our integrated collective coordinates the planning, design, execution, and micro-finishing required to turn that vision into an enduring built environment.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider text-primary mb-1">01 — UNDERSTAND</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Discovery &amp; Feasibility</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Deep dive into spatial requirements, site topography, municipal zoning, and aesthetic ambitions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider text-primary mb-1">02 — PLAN</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Design &amp; Engineering</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Detailed structural schematics, MEP integration, procurement mapping, and fixed schedules.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider text-primary mb-1">03 — BUILD</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Precision Execution</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">On-site coordination, continuous milestone quality audits, and transparent material verification.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-headline font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider text-primary mb-1">04 — COMPLETE</span>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Handover &amp; Care</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Bespoke interior finishing, MEP testing, municipal code certification, and key delivery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
